              <tr><td>Osmotic</td><td>Liquid (salt solution)</td><td>Primer-metal interface</td><td>Weeks–months after application</td><td>Wet interior; high substrate conductivity</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Substrate moisture</td><td>Liquid water</td><td>Film-substrate interface</td><td>Days–weeks after application</td><td>Occurs in humid conditions; porous substrates</td></tr>
